@title A refused terminal edit is a transient triangle in the canvas corner, not a toast
@area Schematic
# T8 on the T7 path: Set terminal level with no strip yet. The edit does not happen; a yellow triangle in the canvas corner holds the reason; the next input clears it. No toast.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text "set terminal level"
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
shot refusal-triangle
check_layout
key Escape
wait 5
key Escape
wait 5
expect_not "No terminal strip yet"
shot refusal-gone
